WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.409 --> 00:00:03.659
Unit nineteen. Safety at Work!

2
00:00:04.575 --> 00:00:08.906
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.956 --> 00:00:11.964
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.014 --> 00:00:15.670
Today we learn about Safety at Work. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.822 --> 00:00:20.855
Workplace. Say it with me. Workplace!

6
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:28.074
Safety. Say it with me. Safety!

7
00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:35.131
Hazard. Say it with me. Hazard!

8
00:00:38.606 --> 00:00:43.173
Protective equipment. Say it with me. Protective equipment!

9
00:00:46.668 --> 00:00:50.285
Training. Say it with me. Training!

10
00:00:53.847 --> 00:00:57.447
Rights. Say it with me. Rights!

11
00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:04.760
Hours. Say it with me. Hours!

12
00:01:08.278 --> 00:01:12.078
Report. Say it with me. Report!

13
00:01:15.557 --> 00:01:26.158
Young workers have the right to a safe workplace. Training, protective equipment, and fair hours reduce each hazard. Workers should report unsafe conditions.

14
00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:29.473
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:30.487 --> 00:01:35.754
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:36.954
Hazard!

17
00:01:37.811 --> 00:01:43.118
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:43.168 --> 00:01:44.318
Hours!

19
00:01:45.386 --> 00:01:51.634
Did you know? Young and new workers are more likely to be injured at work, often due to lack of training!

20
00:01:51.684 --> 00:01:53.811
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:55.224 --> 00:02:03.458
Think and answer. What safety rights should a young worker know?

22
00:02:03.508 --> 00:02:04.658
Great answer!

23
00:02:05.597 --> 00:02:11.060
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:13.916
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

